      "Choose at least two balanced accounting lines.": "请至少选择两条借贷平衡的会计分录。",
      "Choose a supplier, complete valid lines and the applicable approval route.": "请选择供应商、填写有效订单行并选择适用的审批路径。",
      "A balance equals its complete accepted inventory movements.": "库存余额应等于其全部已接收库存流水。",
      "A balance uses its item stock unit or cost currency.": "库存余额使用其物料的库存单位或成本币种。",
      "A component is a different item with a positive quantity.": "组件必须是数量为正且不同于父项的另一物料。",
      "A component occurs once in an item structure.": "同一物料清单中每种组件仅可出现一次。",
      "A movement has exactly one purchase or production origin.": "每笔库存流水只能有一个采购或生产来源。",
      "A production order keeps its complete original component snapshots.": "生产订单须保留完整的原始组件快照。",
      "A purchase line has one original receipt movement.": "每条采购订单行仅对应一笔原始入库流水。",
      "A receipt needs the complete unchanged ordered lines.": "入库须基于完整且未变更的已订购行。",
      "A received order has exactly one original stock receipt.": "已收货订单仅对应一张原始入库单。",
      "A stock receipt belongs to exactly one ordered purchase or running production batch.": "入库单只能属于一张已下单采购订单或一个运行中的生产批次。",
      "A stock receipt retains its accepted original order and date.": "入库单须保留已接收的原始订单和日期。",
      "An accepted production batch has one movement for each item.": "每个已接收生产批次对每种物料仅生成一笔流水。",
      "An account code is unique.": "科目代码必须唯一。",
      "An accounting line has a positive amount on exactly one side.": "每条会计分录须且仅须在借方或贷方之一有正金额。",
      "An approval limit cannot be negative.": "审批限额不能为负。",
      "An authorized supplier inquiry and the original external answer; delivery alone is not a promised lead time.": "已获授权的供应商询问及原始外部答复；仅送达询问不代表已承诺交期。",
      "An item has one balance for each quantity or value bucket.": "每种物料在每个数量或价值分类下仅有一个余额。",
      "Batch quantities must be positive and cannot exceed the remaining production allowance.": "批次数量必须为正，且不得超过剩余生产额度。",
      "Cumulative production, receipts and financial lines equal the accepted batches.": "累计生产、入库和财务分录须与已接收批次一致。",
      "Each material occurs once in the frozen production structure.": "冻结生产结构中每种物料仅可出现一次。",
      "Inventory movement facts match their original purchase line or frozen production batch.": "库存流水事实须与原始采购订单行或冻结生产批次一致。",
      "Inventory value equals quantity at its frozen standard cost.": "库存价值须等于数量乘以冻结标准成本。",
      "Only draft purchase orders accept new lines.": "仅草稿采购订单可新增订单行。",
      "Posted inventory movements are corrected by new business movements.": "已过账库存流水须通过新的业务流水更正。",
      "Production requires an active finished item with a complete bounded material structure in one currency.": "生产要求启用状态的成品，且其物料结构完整、有界并使用同一币种。",
      "Purchase quantity is positive and its price is nonnegative.": "采购数量必须为正，单价不得为负。",
      "Standard cost cannot be negative.": "标准成本不能为负。",
      "Submitted document values and their original parent stay fixed.": "已提交单据的值及其原始归属不可更改。",
      "This production batch identity has already been accepted.": "该生产批次标识已被接收。"
    }
  }
